惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 45.2%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 3.14"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":80.71,"default_fair_val":80.71,"premium_pct":202.6,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":17.9,"pe_forward":15.8,"pb_trailing":3.6,"pb_forward":3.2,"div_yield":0.85,"ps_ratio":8,"fcf_to_ev":7.38,"fcf_to_mcap":3.13,"liab_to_assets":45.2,"cash_to_assets":5.2,"current_ratio":3.14,"roe":19.9,"roa":11,"moat":{"ticker":"STLD","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵產業本質上是商品化程度高的行業，品牌溢價效應有限。STLD 作為領先的鋼鐵生產商，其品牌知名度有助於建立客戶信任和採購偏好，但面對同業競爭時，定價權主要受市場供需關係和原材料成本影響。公司透過提供差異化的產品和服務（如特定規格鋼材、及時交付）來爭取客戶，但難以形成獨立於市場的強勢定價權。其品牌價值更多體現在可靠供應商的聲譽上，而非高毛利的品牌溢價。","comment_en":"The steel industry is inherently commoditized, limiting significant brand pricing power. While Steel Dynamics (STLD) benefits from its reputation as a leading producer, fostering customer trust and preference, its pricing is primarily dictated by market supply/demand dynamics and raw material costs. The company differentiates through product customization and reliable delivery, but this doesn't translate into pricing power independent of the market. Brand value lies more in its reputation as a dependable supplier than in commanding premium prices."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵製造業的技術門檻主要在於生產工藝的效率和成本控制，而非專利保護。STLD 的競爭優勢更多來自於其先進的生產技術和運營效率，而非受專利保護的獨特產品。雖然行業存在環保法規等監管要求，但這對所有參與者都適用，並未形成 STLD 獨有的壁壘。公司在技術創新上投入，但難以形成類似製藥或科技行業那樣由專利壁壘構成的強大護城河。","comment_en":"Barriers in steel manufacturing stem from production efficiency and cost control rather than patent protection. STLD's competitive edge arises from its advanced manufacturing and operational efficiency, not from patented, unique products. While environmental regulations exist, they apply industry-wide and do not create a unique barrier for STLD. The company invests in technological innovation, but it doesn't establish a strong moat based on patents, unlike in pharmaceuticals or technology."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"對於標準化鋼材產品，客戶轉換供應商的成本相對較低，主要取決於價格、質量和交付可靠性。然而，對於需要特定規格、定制化鋼材的客戶，或與 STLD 建立長期合作關係的客戶，轉換成本會有所增加。這包括重新驗證供應商、調整生產流程以及潛在的供應中斷風險。STLD 透過提供穩定可靠的供應和技術支持，在一定程度上增加了客戶的轉換難度，但整體而言，轉換成本壁壘不算特別高。","comment_en":"For standard steel products, customer switching costs are relatively low, primarily driven by price, quality, and delivery reliability. However, for customers requiring specific specifications or customized steel, or those with long-standing relationships, switching costs increase. This involves re-qualifying suppliers, adjusting production processes, and managing potential supply disruptions. STLD mitigates this somewhat by offering consistent supply and technical support, but overall, the switching cost barrier is not exceptionally high."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵行業幾乎不存在網絡效應。產品的價值和公司的成功主要取決於生產能力、成本結構、產品質量和客戶服務，而非用戶之間的互動或平台效應。STLD 的業務模式不依賴於網絡效應來擴大其競爭優勢。客戶選擇供應商是基於產品規格、價格和可靠性，而不是因為其他客戶在使用 STLD 的產品。","comment_en":"Network effects are virtually non-existent in the steel industry. The value of the product and a company's success are primarily determined by production capacity, cost structure, product quality, and customer service, not by interactions among users or platform effects. STLD's business model does not rely on network effects to enhance its competitive advantage. Customers choose suppliers based on specifications, price, and reliability, not because other customers are using STLD's products."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"STLD 透過其先進的直流弧爐（EAF）技術和垂直整合模式，實現了顯著的規模經濟和成本優勢。相較於傳統高爐煉鋼，EAF 更具靈活性，能有效利用廢鋼，且資本支出和運營成本較低。公司持續擴大產能，優化生產流程，並透過多元化的產品組合來分散風險。這種規模化的、低成本的生產能力是其核心競爭力，使其能在鋼鐵市場的週期性波動中保持較強的盈利能力。","comment_en":"Steel Dynamics (STLD) leverages significant economies of scale and cost advantages through its advanced electric arc furnace (EAF) technology and vertically integrated model. EAFs offer greater flexibility and lower capital/operational costs compared to traditional blast furnaces, effectively utilizing scrap metal. Continuous capacity expansion and process optimization, coupled with a diversified product portfolio, enhance its resilience. This scaled, low-cost production capability is a core competitive strength, enabling strong profitability through steel market cycles."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"STLD 的工廠遍佈美國戰略性地理位置，靠近原材料供應源和主要客戶市場，這有助於降低運輸成本和縮短交付時間。然而，這些地理位置並非絕對獨特，競爭對手同樣可以選擇靠近資源或市場的設廠地點。其資產的價值更多體現在高效的運營和現代化的設施上，而非地理位置的不可複製性。這種佈局優勢是重要的，但不足以構成獨立的、難以模仿的壁壘。","comment_en":"STLD's strategically located plants across the US, close to raw material sources and key customer markets, help reduce transportation costs and shorten delivery times. However, these locations are not uniquely exclusive, as competitors can also choose sites near resources or markets. The value of its assets lies more in efficient operations and modern facilities than in the irreplicability of their geography. While this locational advantage is important, it doesn't constitute an insurmountable barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"STLD 在運營效率方面表現卓越，其 EAF 技術和精益生產管理使其能夠以較低的成本生產高質量的鋼材。公司持續投資於技術升級和自動化，以提高生產力並減少浪費。相較於行業內依賴傳統高爐的競爭對手，STLD 的運營模式更具彈性和成本效益。這種持續的卓越運營能力，加上對市場需求的敏銳洞察，是其長期以來保持高 ROIC 的關鍵，構成了堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"STLD demonstrates exceptional operational efficiency, utilizing its EAF technology and lean manufacturing principles to produce high-quality steel at a lower cost. Continuous investment in technological upgrades and automation enhances productivity and minimizes waste. Compared to competitors relying on traditional blast furnaces, STLD's operational model is more agile and cost-effective. This sustained operational excellence, combined with keen market insight, is key to its consistently high ROIC and forms a robust economic moat."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"STLD 的管理層在資本配置方面展現出卓越的紀律和遠見。他們能夠準確把握行業週期，在適當時機進行擴張投資（如新建或收購 EAF 工廠），並在市場低迷時保持審慎。公司積極回購股票，並在財務狀況允許時支付股息，有效提升股東回報。其對債務的審慎管理和對現金流的重視，確保了公司在面對市場波動時的財務韌性，體現了巴菲特所欣賞的資本配置能力。","comment_en":"STLD's management exhibits excellent discipline and foresight in capital allocation. They adeptly navigate industry cycles, investing in expansion (new builds, acquisitions) at opportune times and maintaining prudence during downturns. The company actively engages in share buybacks and pays dividends when financially feasible, effectively enhancing shareholder returns. Prudent debt management and a focus on cash flow ensure financial resilience amidst market volatility, reflecting the capital allocation acumen Buffett values."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"STLD 透過提供可靠的產品質量、穩定的供應和良好的客戶服務，建立了穩固的客戶基礎。對於需要特定鋼材規格和可靠交付的客戶而言，STLD 是值得信賴的合作夥伴。公司與主要客戶建立了長期的合作關係，這在一定程度上提高了客戶黏性。然而，由於鋼鐵產品的商品化屬性，以及潛在的價格競爭，客戶忠誠度並非牢不可破，仍需持續努力來維持和加深客戶關係。","comment_en":"STLD has built a solid customer base through reliable product quality, consistent supply, and strong customer service. For clients needing specific steel specifications and dependable delivery, STLD is a trusted partner. Long-term relationships with key customers contribute to a degree of stickiness. However, given the commoditized nature of steel and potential price competition, customer loyalty is not absolute and requires ongoing effort to maintain and deepen."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵行業具有一定的週期性，但 STLD 的業務模式，特別是其對 EAF 技術的依賴和多元化的產品組合（包括扁鋼、長材和結構鋼），使其能夠更好地抵禦行業下行風險。公司持續的技術創新和對運營效率的關注，有助於維持其在不同市場環境下的競爭力。雖然無法完全擺脫宏觀經濟和行業週期的影響，但其相對穩健的成本結構和靈活的生產能力，賦予了其較強的業務持久性。","comment_en":"While the steel industry is cyclical, STLD's business model, particularly its reliance on EAF technology and diversified product mix (flat, long, and structural steel), enhances its resilience against downturns. Continuous technological innovation and a focus on operational efficiency help maintain competitiveness across various market conditions. Although not immune to macroeconomic and industry cycles, its relatively robust cost structure and flexible production capabilities provide considerable business durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Steel Dynamics (STLD) 在鋼鐵這個高度週期性且商品化的行業中，展現了卓越的競爭優勢。其核心護城河來自於領先的 EAF 技術帶來的規模經濟和成本領先（M5），以及由此衍生的極高運營效率（M7）。管理層展現了優秀的資本配置能力（M8），能夠在擴張與回報股東之間取得平衡。儘管品牌（M1）和轉換成本（M3）壁壘相對較弱，且缺乏專利（M2）和網絡效應（M4），但其成本優勢和運營效率構成了類似於「低成本製造商」的護城河，使其在行業競爭中脫穎而出，具備較強的持久性（M10）。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Steel Dynamics (STLD) possesses significant competitive advantages within the highly cyclical and commoditized steel industry. Its primary moat stems from economies of scale and cost leadership derived from its leading EAF technology (M5), coupled with exceptional operational efficiency (M7). Management demonstrates strong capital allocation skills (M8), balancing expansion with shareholder returns. While brand (M1) and switching cost (M3) moats are weaker, and patent (M2) and network effects (M4) are absent, its cost advantage and operational excellence create a 'low-cost producer' type of moat. This allows STLD to outperform competitors and exhibit considerable business durability (M10).","evidenceHash":"e9dfe210ae1a9aa1165aee52eeb40a95327b508f69df1c411448d12355851212","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"5383b9d673c95d71ded2eaa32b7ae35a2db272fbb986581c01443966738d37f0"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"5383b9d673c95d71ded2eaa32b7ae35a2db272fbb986581c01443966738d37f0"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/STLD.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/STLD.png","website":"https://www.steeldynamics.com","ceo":"Mark D. Millett","full_time_employees":"14400","description":"Steel Dynamics, Inc. is a prominent American steel manufacturer and metal recycling enterprise, conducting its operations through three distinct business divisions. The Steel Operations segment is responsible for producing a broad range of steel products, including hot, cold, and coated rolled steel, various structural shapes like beams, channels, and angles, flat and reinforcing bars, and a diverse selection of rail and engineered steel bar products. This segment also provides specialized processing services for both bar products (such as turning, polishing, and heat treating) and specialty items (including cutting, welding, and galvanizing). Its offerings cater to numerous industries, such as construction, automotive, manufacturing, transportation, heavy and agricultural equipment, and pipe and tube production. Sales are channeled directly to end-users, steel fabricators, and service centers. The Metals Recycling Operations division focuses on acquiring, processing, and reselling ferrous (e.g., heavy melting steel, shredded scrap, cast iron) and nonferrous (e.g., aluminum, copper, stainless steel) scrap metals, transforming them into reusable materials. This division further offers supplementary services including transportation logistics, marketing, brokerage, and scrap management. The Steel Fabrication Operations segment manufactures crucial components for commercial building construction, such as steel joists, girders, trusses, and steel deck products. Established in 1993 and headquartered in Fort Wayne, Indiana, the company also engages in exporting its products internationally.","description_en":"Steel Dynamics, Inc. is a prominent American steel manufacturer and metal recycling enterprise, conducting its operations through three distinct business divisions. The Steel Operations segment is responsible for producing a broad range of steel products, including hot, cold, and coated rolled steel, various structural shapes like beams, channels, and angles, flat and reinforcing bars, and a diverse selection of rail and engineered steel bar products. This segment also provides specialized processing services for both bar products (such as turning, polishing, and heat treating) and specialty items (including cutting, welding, and galvanizing). Its offerings cater to numerous industries, such as construction, automotive, manufacturing, transportation, heavy and agricultural equipment, and pipe and tube production. Sales are channeled directly to end-users, steel fabricators, and service centers. The Metals Recycling Operations division focuses on acquiring, processing, and reselling ferrous (e.g., heavy melting steel, shredded scrap, cast iron) and nonferrous (e.g., aluminum, copper, stainless steel) scrap metals, transforming them into reusable materials. This division further offers supplementary services including transportation logistics, marketing, brokerage, and scrap management. The Steel Fabrication Operations segment manufactures crucial components for commercial building construction, such as steel joists, girders, trusses, and steel deck products. Established in 1993 and headquartered in Fort Wayne, Indiana, the company also engages in exporting its products internationally.","description_zh":"**Steel Dynamics, Inc. (STLD) 業務營運概述**\n\nSteel Dynamics, Inc. (STLD) 是一家領先的美國鋼鐵製造商與金屬回收企業，營運劃分為三大事業部門。\n\n**鋼鐵事業 (Steel Operations)**：此部門專注於生產多元化的鋼鐵產品，涵蓋熱軋、冷軋及塗鍍鋼捲，以及各種結構鋼材（如H型鋼、槽鋼、角鋼）、扁鋼、鋼筋，還有軌道鋼及特殊合金鋼棒材。此外，亦提供鋼棒產品（如車削、拋光、熱處理）及特殊鋼材（如裁切、焊接、鍍鋅）的加工服務。產品廣泛應用於建築、汽車、製造、運輸、重型及農業設備、管材生產等產業。銷售通路直接面向終端用戶、鋼結構加工廠及服務中心。\n\n**金屬回收事業 (Metals Recycling Operations)**：此部門主要從事黑色金屬（如重熔廢鋼、碎鋼、鑄鐵）及有色金屬（如鋁、銅、不鏽鋼）廢料的收購、加工與再銷售，將其轉化為可再利用的材料。並提供運輸物流、市場行銷、經紀及廢料管理等附加服務。\n\n**鋼結構加工事業 (Steel Fabrication Operations)**：此部門製造商業建築所需的關鍵鋼結構組件，包括鋼桁架、大樑、鋼骨架及鋼承板等。\n\nSTLD 成立於 1993 年，總部位於印第安納州韋恩堡，業務亦拓展至國際出口。","address":"7575 West Jefferson Boulevard","city":"Fort Wayne","state":"IN","zip":"46804","country":"US","phone":"260 969 3500","full_address":"7575 West Jefferson Boulevard, Fort Wayne, IN 46804, US","range_52w":"148.13-288.74","year_high":288.74,"year_low":148.13,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":148.13,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Sierra Luis Manuel","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":7,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Seaman Bradley S","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":105,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Hamann Jennifer L","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":18,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"DOLAN TRACI M","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":97,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Cornew Kenneth W.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"BARGABOS SHEREE L","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":40,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-14","name":"Hamann Jennifer L","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":72,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-28","name":"MILLETT MARK D","title":"director, officer: Chairman and CEO","is_buy":null,"action":"G-Gift","shares":300,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-14","name":"Sierra Luis Manuel","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":7,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-07-14","name":"Seaman Bradley S","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","s